
BAT-01 — same seed + same snapshot => identical full log:
ok   stage 1 settles
ok   replayed log matches the settled log event-for-event
ok   replayed winner matches the settled winner
ok   replayAs is a frozen copy, not the live plant

BAT-02 — a cleared stage can never pay twice:
ok   first run wins or at least settles
ok   re-running a cleared stage refuses
ok   no second stage reward line exists
ok   balance unchanged by the refused re-run

BAT-02 — reward lines are written exactly once per settle:
ok   battle counter moves once
ok   win or loss recorded exactly once on the fighter

BAT-02/05 — replayAs freezes pre-settle stats; payout can't rewrite the fight:
ok   settle moved plant XP/level on the live plant
ok   replayAs kept the pre-settle level

BAT-02 — a loss still settles once, then allows the next attempt:
